OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow Subway closed after train
OL,4,Afailure at depot
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow Subway has been suspended after
OL,7,Fa train failure at the depot.
OL,9,FOperator Strathclyde Partnership for
OL,10,FTransport (SPT) said both the inner and
OL,11,Fouter circles were shut down during one
OL,12,Fthe busiest periods of the day.
OL,14,FIt said staff were working to get
OL,15,Ftrains running again as soon as
OL,16,Fpossible.
